description	"Jedi Knight X2

Weaponry:
Fists
Lightsaber (Defense 3; Yellow, Red, Blue styles)

Force Powers:
Push 3
Jump 3
Sense 3
Speed 3
Saber Throw 3
Team Heal 2
Deflect 3

Attributes:
Self Heal 3
Saber resistance
Strong against melee
BP free jumps
Can deflect during swings

X2, along with his brother X1, was a force-sensitive clone trooper of the Galactic Republic, secretly created from Jedi Knight Falon Grey's DNA. 
Shortly after Order 66 X2 defected from the newly formed Empire, joining his genetic donor whose he considered as father on Dantooine. Imperial attack on Dantooine led by X1 then resulted in Falon Grey's death, who eventually sacrifised himself to save X2.
Fifteen years later X2 was recruited by Rahm Kota to the cause of Rebel Alliance.
After the creation of the New Republic X2, under Luke Skywalker's tutelage, became a Jedi Knight."


